   "stem": {
      "text": "The Maclaurin series for \\( f(x) = 6 e^{-x} \\) is \\( \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} 6 \\frac{(-1)^n x^n}{n!} \\). Let \\( S_{3} = \\sum_{n=0}^{3} 6 \\frac{(-1)^n x^n}{n!} \\) evaluated at \\( x = \\frac{3}{4} \\) approximate \\( f(\\frac{3}{4}) \\). Use the alternating series error bound to find the exact value of an upper bound for \\( \\left|f(\\frac{3}{4}) - S_{3}\\right| \\).",
      "command_verb": "find"
   },
